      "rationale": "'nuqqa\/nukk' ilugan n taɛbranit 'ṭṭef\/kkes' — yessegem-nnes (nakrez\/ayen icudden ɣer yil) deg unamek n 'ur nukku ara yiwet seg lmal'."
