      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "maḍal",
      "rationale": "Aḥav yesselmad Ɛovadyahu ad yeddu seg tillist n yiman-is; deg wayen ara yaf, ad yaf iseɛɛaden i lmal."
    }
